{"article_ids": ["6fff2f1ea4fe6c4f"], "canonical_title": "PTC-Bias: Phoneme-Level Temporal Competition for Bias Retrieval and Post-Decoding Correction in Speech LLMs", "category": "research", "confidence": 0.8, "description": "The paper proposes PTC-Bias, a two‑stage framework for contextual biasing in speech large language models. In the prefill stage, PTC Retrieval performs frame‑synchronous phoneme decoding and temporal competition among candidate pronunciations, yielding a compact shortlist of bias words and associated speech information. A subsequent post‑decoding correction stage refines the output using the shortlist.", "entities": ["term:ptc"], "first_seen": "2026-09-25T04:00:00Z", "id": "evt_6fff2f1ea4fe6c4f", "importance_score": 5.84, "last_updated": "2026-09-25T04:00:00Z", "source_ids": ["arxiv-cs-cl"]}
